#: kstart.cpp:255
msgid "Command to execute"
msgstr "Comande a enonder"

#: kstart.cpp:257
msgid "A regular expression matching the window title"
msgstr "Ene ratourneure ki rote avou l' tite do purnea"

#: kstart.cpp:258
msgid ""
"A string matching the window class (WM_CLASS property)\n"
"The window class can be found out by running\n"
"'xprop | grep WM_CLASS' and clicking on a window\n"
"(use either both parts separated by a space or only the right part).\n"
"NOTE: If you specify neither window title nor window class,\n"
"then the very first window to appear will be taken;\n"
"omitting both options is NOT recommended."
msgstr ""
"On messaedje ki rote avou l' classe di purnea (prôpieté WM_CLASS).\n"
"Li classe di purnea pout esse trovêye en enondant\n"
"'xprop | grep WM_CLASS' et e clitchant so-z on purnea\n"
"(eployîz les deus pårts metowes a pårt pa-z on espace ou kel droete pårt).\n"
"NOTE: Si vos n' sipecifyîz ni tite di purnea ni classe di purnea,\n"
"dabôrd li prumî purnea k' aparetrè serè prindou;\n"
"ni dire nole des deus tchuzes n' est nén ricomandé."

#: kstart.cpp:265
msgid "Desktop on which to make the window appear"
msgstr "Sicribanne wice mete li purnea"

#: kstart.cpp:266
msgid ""
"Make the window appear on the desktop that was active\n"
"when starting the application"
msgstr ""
"Fé aparete li purnea sol sicribanne k' esteut en alaedje\n"
"cwand l' programe a stî enondé"

#: kstart.cpp:267
msgid "Make the window appear on all desktops"
msgstr "Fé aparete li purnea so totes les sicribannes"

#: kstart.cpp:268
msgid "Iconify the window"
msgstr "Mete li purneas a imådjete"

#: kstart.cpp:269
msgid "Maximize the window"
msgstr "Mete li purnea å pus grand"

#: kstart.cpp:270
msgid "Maximize the window vertically"
msgstr "Mete li purnea d' astampé"

#: kstart.cpp:271
msgid "Maximize the window horizontally"
msgstr "Mete li purnea coûtchî"

#: kstart.cpp:272
msgid "Show window fullscreen"
msgstr "Håyner l' purnea so tote li waitroûle"

#: kstart.cpp:273
msgid ""
"The window type: Normal, Desktop, Dock, Tool, \n"
"Menu, Dialog, TopMenu or Override"
msgstr ""
"Li sôre di purnea: Normå, Sicribanne, Dock, Usteye, \n"
"Dressêye, Divize, Dressêye di dvant ou Disfacer"

#: kstart.cpp:274
msgid ""
"Jump to the window even if it is started on a \n"
"different virtual desktop"
msgstr ""
"Hopler å purnea minme si l' a stî enondé so-z ene\n"
"ôte forveyowe sicribanne"

#: kstart.cpp:277
msgid "Try to keep the window above other windows"
msgstr "Sayî d' wårder l' purnea pa dzeu ls ôtes purneas"

#: kstart.cpp:279
msgid "Try to keep the window below other windows"
msgstr "Sayî d' wårder l' purnea pa dzo ls ôtes purnea"

#: kstart.cpp:280
msgid "The window does not get an entry in the taskbar"
msgstr "Li purnea n' a pont d' intrêye dins l' bår ås bouyes"

#: kstart.cpp:281
msgid "The window does not get an entry on the pager"
msgstr "Li purnea n' a pont d' intrêye sol pådjeu"

#: kstart.cpp:282
msgid "The window is sent to the system tray in Kicker"
msgstr "Li purnea est evoyî sol platea sistinme"

#: kstart.cpp:289
msgid "KStart"
msgstr "KStart"

#: kstart.cpp:290
msgid ""
"Utility to launch applications with special window properties \n"
"such as iconified, maximized, a certain virtual desktop, a special decoration\n"
"and so on."
msgstr ""
"Usteye po lancî on programe avou des speciålès prôpietés d' purnea\n"
"come li mete en imådjete, å pus grand, dins ene certinne forveyowe sicribanne,\n"
"on speciå gåliotaedje et vos nd åroz."

#: kstart.cpp:310
msgid "No command specified"
msgstr "Nole comande di dnêye"

